OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is so little council-owned art
OL,4,Aout on display?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe majority of artworks owned by North
OL,7,FEast councils are not being displayed,
OL,8,Fwith some authorities in the region
OL,9,Fexhibiting less than 10% of their
OL,10,Fcollections, figures have revealed.
OL,12,FAccording to data obtained by the BBC
OL,13,Fthrough a freedom of information
OL,14,Frequest, only 3% of the art owned by
OL,15,FNewcastle City Council is currently on
OL,16,Fdisplay, with South Tyneside and Redcar
OL,17,Fand Cleveland showing 8% each.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
