OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is so little council-owned art
OL,4,Aout on display?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Sunderland 11% is displayed and
OL,7,FDurham is showing 12% of its
OL,8,Fcollection. About 15% is on show in
OL,9,FStockton. North Tyneside and Gateshead
OL,10,Fare the only local authorities to show
OL,11,Fnearly half of their collections, at
OL,12,F45% and 47% respectively.
OL,14,FWhy is so much art kept in storage?
